+ *  - bootloader2: the trusted key certificate (TRUSTED_KEY_CERT_ID) carries
+ *    only the trusted world key and certifies the BL31 and BL32 chains.
+ *  - bootloader3: its own trusted key certificate (NON_TRUSTED_KEY_CERT_ID,
+ *    file trusted_key_no.crt), signed by the same root of trust and without
+ *    NV counter, carries the non-trusted world key for the BL33 chain.
+ *
+ * Both are verified against the root of trust; the CIX BL2 skips the
+ * signature check of NON_TRUSTED_KEY_CERT_ID.
+ */
